# Turtle attacks, cannot attack on its controller's next turn, then can attack again; another creature may attack during the skipped turn (CR 508.1c).

[Bot1 Deck]
Giant Turtle
Black Lotus
Ornithopter
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Giant Turtle.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Giant Turtle > Bot2)
